Profile URI used in the Model Exchange header and defined in IEC standards.  It uniquely identifies the Profile and its version. The last two elements in the URI (e.g. http://iec.ch/TC57/61970-452/CoreEquipment/yy/zzz) indicate major and minor versions where: 
- yy - indicates a major version;
- zzz - indicates a minor version.

Profile URI defined for an European profile and used in the Model Exchange header.  It uniquely identifies the Profile and its version. The last two elements in the URI (e.g. http://iec.ch/TC57/61970-452/CoreEquipment-European/yy/zzz) indicate major and minor versions where: 
- yy - indicates a major version;
- zzz - indicates a minor version.
